{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Clockchain v1",
    "version": "1.2",
    "summary": "Public read gateway (/public/v1) and private node API.",
    "description": "Generated from source by hand and checked against the routers by ops/test_openapi_routes.py: cc-gateway (crates/cc-gateway/src/lib.rs router) and cc-node v1 (crates/cc-node/src/serve_v1.rs router_with). Contract prose: docs/PUBLIC-ACCESS.md (gateway) and docs/USING-THE-NODE.md (node). Map of the whole stack: docs/TOPOLOGY.md.\n\nGateway rules: GET/HEAD only (other methods 405 read_only, OPTIONS 204), unknown paths 404 no_such_route, 60 requests/min per client address (429 rate_limited with Retry-After), every response carries CORS `*`, cache-control no-store, nosniff, no-referrer and a deny-all CSP. Unknown or repeated query parameters are 400 invalid_query."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://clockchain.timepointai.com",
      "description": "Public read gateway (cc-gateway); also https://timepoint-clockchain-gateway.fly.dev"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "public",
      "description": "Unauthenticated, read-only. Served by cc-gateway."
    },
    {
      "name": "node",
      "description": "Private v1 node. Not reachable from the internet."
    }
  ],
